      * Regression for the guards after STOP RUN / GOBACK, for RUN,
      * for VERIFY STOP and for test case classification. The last
      * test case name is exactly 60 characters (CBLT-CASE-NAME limit).
       TESTSUITE TSTGUARD 'guards after STOP'
       PROGRAM GUARD

       BEFORE-EACH
           MOVE "A" TO WS-MODE
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-STEP
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-TRACE
       END-BEFORE

       TESTCASE 'normal path: final STOP RUN, every step'
           RUN
           EXPECT WS-STEP TO BE NUMERIC 4
           EXPECT WS-TRACE TO BE 'WORKED'
           VERIFY STOP HAPPENED ONCE

       TESTCASE 'STOP RUN in the IF: rest of the paragraph does not run'
           MOVE "X" TO WS-MODE
           RUN
           EXPECT WS-STEP TO BE NUMERIC 1
           EXPECT WS-TRACE TO BE 'ABORT'
           VERIFY STOP HAPPENED ONCE
           VERIFY PARAGRAPH 1000-WORK NEVER HAPPENED

       TESTCASE 'inner GOBACK: its paragraph and caller do not go on'
           MOVE "G" TO WS-MODE
           RUN
           EXPECT WS-TRACE TO BE 'GOBACK'
           EXPECT WS-STEP TO BE NUMERIC 2
           EXPECT CBLT-STOPPED TO BE TRUE
           VERIFY STOP HAPPENED ONCE
           VERIFY PARAGRAPH 1000-WORK HAPPENED ONCE

       TESTCASE 'solely through the interface: it stops once and nothing more'
           RUN
           EXPECT CBLT-STOPPED TO BE TRUE
           VERIFY STOP HAPPENED ONCE
